 line and move $2$ places to the left, which brings us to $2.$\n\n- Then, we move the remaining $0.5$ places to the left, leaving us at $1.5.$\n\n![](images/7a/7a8da5cb86ba9b216f854161c9be51fbd394a3b7e218fdb2fe4d56891ab258a9.png)\n\nThis gives $4-2.5=1.5.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186444447 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186179813 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "507d4d46-699c-5b4f-a010-66aec6abef67" :knowledge-point/title "Subtracting Positive Decimals From Decimals"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "707a87b1-68b1-588d-b973-f69618098629" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-8.6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186444396}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "707a87b1-68b1-588d-b973-f69618098629" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-8.6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186444396} :answer-field/id #uuid "38e17c17-8426-5adb-8ce0-036d06f3c275" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186444420}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "878f1e7f-afb5-5706-a035-9ec1ffd67f97" :question/math-academy-id "q-186106" :question/problem "$-4.4-4.2=${{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "The answer will be negative since $-4.4$ is negative, and we're subtracting $4.2$ from it.\n\nWe start by solving an easier problem, which is to add their absolute values:\n\n$$\n4.4+4.2=8.6\n$$\n\nHowever, since our answer must be negative, we need to change the sign of the answer above. \n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n-4.4-4.2=-8.6.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186444441 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186179813 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "507d4d46-699c-5b4f-a010-66aec6abef67" :knowledge-point/title "Subtracting Positive Decimals From Decimals"}] :question/answer-fields 